  <a class="title-link" href="/news/2026/hawkstrong-alicia-jackson-finds-transfer-success">
    <img src="/sites/hfcmain/files/styles/medium/public/photos/2026-10/alicia_jackson-600x440.png?itok=Kd_2DhZa" width="600" height="440" alt="Alicia Jackson giving the thumbs up in her cap and gown." loading="lazy" class="image-style-medium" />


    <h3><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">Alicia Jackson found HFC a great foundation for transferring</span>
</h3>
  </a>
  
  <div class="content">
    
            <div class="field field--name-field-news-cut-line field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item">HFC provided a strong foundation for Alicia Jackson to transfer to U-M. She has started a business, completed a bachelor&#039;s degree, holds a job, and is now pursuing graduate work at Wayne State. </div>
      
  </div>
</div>
</div>

    </div>
    

  
  

  
  
</div>
