  <div class="content">
          <div class="views-row">  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/hfcmain/files/photos/2026-10/dominic_deyonker-600x440.png" width="600" height="440" alt="Dominic Deyonker headshot" />

<h3><a href="https://www.hfcc.edu/news/2026/hfc-welcomes-dominic-deyonker">Alumnus Dominic DeYonker brings Marine Corps experience to Campus Safety</a></h3>HFC Campus Safety Associate Dominic DeYonker is also an alumnus and served overseas in the Marines. </div>
    <div class="views-row">  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/hfcmain/files/photos/2026-10/dia_camera-600x440.png" width="600" height="440" alt="Dia Camera headshot outside" />

<h3><a href="https://www.hfcc.edu/news/2026/hawkstrong-dia-camara">National Transfer Student Week Spotlight: alumnus Dia Camara</a></h3>HFC experiences provided Dia Camara a sense of normalcy after the pandemic, gave him the drive to succeed academically. </div>
    <div class="views-row">  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/hfcmain/files/photos/2026-02/sedra_mourad-600x440.jpg" width="600" height="440" alt="Headshot of Sedra Mourad" />

<h3><a href="https://www.hfcc.edu/news/2026/hawkstrong-sedra-mourad-0">UROP, Honors experiences set stage for Mourad’s path to med school</a></h3>HFC student Sedra Mourad has had a broad variety of research, academic, and co-curricular experiences while at HFC. She plans to attend U-M to work toward a career in medicine. </div>

