          </div>
  
    </div>
            <div  class="hfc-show-content">
            <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--simple-text-area paragraph--view-mode--default">
              
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-long-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>You'll find theatre, music, art, student publications, WHFR radio, the 5101 student-run restaurant, multicultural experiences, and more.</p>

