            <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--simple-text-area paragraph--view-mode--default">
              
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-long-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Hawks athletics teams compete in Michigan and nationally. We offer 7 varsity teams: basketball (M/W), baseball, golf (M/W), softball, volleyball, and wrestling.</p>

